e>KOBAYASHI SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook> </applicant> <applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEGAWA HIROYUKI</name> <address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SONY CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIGAHARA TAKAYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, SEIJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEGAWA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIGAHARA, TAKAYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEGAWA HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIGAHARA TAKAYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, SEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEGAWA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIGAHARA, TAKAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>The three-dimensional shape of the body of the user can be safely and simply used. A three-dimensional measuring system measures the three-dimensional shape of the user, compares it with the shape of a standard model, creates a feature parameter according to the comparison results, and records the feature parameter in a recorder. The parameter is applied to a character standard model of a two-player game and a character reflecting the physical feature of the user is created. A two-player game is played with another character similarly created.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On utilise, simplement et en toute sécurité, dans le cadre de cette invention, les formes tridimensionnelles du corps d'un individu. Un système de mesure en trois dimensions prend les mesures desdites formes tridimensionnelles de l'individu, les compare à celles d'un modèle type, crée un paramètre de caractéristique d'après les résultats de la comparaison et enregistre ce paramètre de caractéristique dans un enregistreur. On applique ce paramètre à un modèle type de personnage de jeu à deux joueurs et on crée un personnage correspondant aux caractéristiques physiques de l'individu susmentionné. Le jeu à deux joueurs se joue avec un autre personnage créé de la même manière.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>